        "original_id": "b97cbcfa-95c4-582f-bc17-977f63909949",
        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- People: Jaclyn Stapp, Scott Stapp, Mark Tremonti\n- Bands: Creed, Art of Anarchy\n- Albums: Weathered\n\nFacts:\n- Scott Stapp was the frontman of Creed before becoming the frontman of Art of Anarchy.\n- In 2001, Creed released its third album, \"Weathered,\" with Mark Tremonti handling bass.\n- In 2004, Creed disbanded because of increasing tension between members.\n- Jaclyn Stapp is married to Scott Stapp.",
